DTSTART:20260710T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:[water-sport]\nPublic - Join us for our SUP & Kayaking 101 Onli
	ne Webinar and learn how to get started paddling near Houston without buyi
	ng gear\, storing gear\, transporting gear\, or randomly guessing where it
	’s safe to go.\n\nhttps://htxoutdoors.com/events/sup-kayaking-101-2/\n\nFr
